# WorkerKit should therefore expose runtimes as actions

Something like:

```text
                 DecisionPoint
                       │
              estimated difficulty
              novelty / uncertainty
              precedent availability
              stakes / remaining budget
                       │
                       ▼
                   ALLOCATOR
                       │
       ┌───────────────┼────────────────┐
       ▼               ▼                ▼
    DIRECT       LETTA-STATEFUL     ESCALATED
   one-shot         memory             reason
   cheap             tools             search
       │               │                │
       └───────────────┼────────────────┘
                       ▼
                     ACT
```

The 35-second path isn't necessarily bad.

**Choosing it for `echo FAST_OK > file` is bad.**

That distinction is fundamental.

